guarantee: AC-1: stop_recording send Err (dead receiver) ignored instead of routed to worker_ended
file: crates/voicen-core/src/dictation.rs
added_by: test-writer
equivalent: the sent == Some(false) branch needs a receiver dropped while worker_stopped is still false, but the only way a worker ends without shutdown is WorkerExit, which sets worker_stopped under the lock before the receiver drops (and a shutdown leaves queue None, so sent is None); the branch is unreachable, kept as defence in depth
--- old
            if sent == Some(false) {
--- new
            if false && sent == Some(false) {
--- end
